@Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress = https://localhost:46612
@customerId=143

### GetCustomers - page 1, 100 customers per page
# @name GetCustomers
GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers
Accept: application/json
x-pageSize: 100

### GetCustomers - page 2, using the continuation token from page 1
GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers
Accept: application/json
x-pageSize: 100
x-continuation-token: {{GetCustomers.response.body.$.continuationToken}}

### GetCustomers - page 1 with the total count
# @name GetCustomersWithTotalCount
GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers?includeTotalCount=true
Accept: application/json
x-pageSize: 100

### GetCustomers - page 2 with the total count (the total travels in the token)
GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers?includeTotalCount=true
Accept: application/json
x-pageSize: 100
x-continuation-token: {{GetCustomersWithTotalCount.response.body.$.continuationToken}}

### GetCustomers - an unreadable continuation token (-> 400)
GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers
Accept: application/json
x-continuation-token: not-a-token

### GetCustomerById

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomerSales

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/sales
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomersStream - direct streaming

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/stream
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomersStreamWithStreamingQueryResult - buffered streaming, with header, schema and completion

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/stream-with-streaming-query-result
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomersStreamCancelDemo - cancels after 50 ms, also on the cluster

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/stream-cancel-demo
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomersStreamCancelDemoNoServer - cancels after 50 ms, the query keeps running on the cluster

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/stream-cancel-demo-no-server
Accept: application/json

### GetNycTaxiTripsStream - direct streaming of a large result (NoTruncation)

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/nyctaxitrips/stream
Accept: application/json

### GetNycTaxiTripsStreamWithStreamingQueryResult - buffered streaming of a large result (the whole result is read into memory first)

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/nyctaxitrips/stream-with-streaming-query-result
Accept: application/json

### IngestDeviceReadings (default mode: ManagedStreaming -> 200 when streamed, 202 when it fell back to queued)
# Needs Ingestion:HostAddress / Ingestion:DatabaseName in appsettings and setup.kql from Atc.Kusto.Ingestion.Sample.
POST {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/device-readings
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "deviceId": "device-1", "serialNumber": "SN-0001", "value": 21.5, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T08:00:00Z" },
  { "deviceId": "device-2", "serialNumber": "SN-0002", "value": 22.0, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T08:00:00Z" }
]

### IngestDeviceReadings queued (-> 202 Accepted)
POST {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/device-readings?mode=Queued
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "deviceId": "device-3", "serialNumber": "SN-0003", "value": 19.0, "timestamp": "2026-10-09T08:05:00Z" }
]

### IngestDeviceReadings empty batch (-> 200 with status Skipped, cluster not contacted)
POST {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/device-readings
Content-Type: application/json

[]

###
